('rope-titanium-50m','ppe',45,'Titanium Rope 50m','12mm Titanium rope. 50m. EN 1891/A.','<p>Highly resistant <strong>Titanium rope</strong>, 12 mm in diameter with eyelets and seams protected by plastic covers, <strong>suitable for climbing activities.</strong></p>
