('dune-jaq','overview',0,'The Dune JAQ is a versatile low-cut safety shoe designed for light to medium work environments. Its Jaquard + TPU upper provides a balance of breathability and structural support, while the ESD certification makes it suitable for electronics and sensitive environments.'),
('dune-jaq','overview',1,'Available in three colourways (yellow/black, lime/black, grey/black) and an extended size range starting from 36, the JAQ covers a wide audience. New sizes 36–39 have been added to the range.'),
