<p>The <strong>adjustable head harness </strong>allows even pressure distribution and ensures a <strong>stable and secure seal on the face</strong>, improving the effectiveness of the filter mask during work activities. The inhalation and exhalation valves are designed to facilitate breathing and reduce fatigue, while the fastening clips allow quick wearing and easy adjustment.</p>
<p><br />The protective mask is <strong>supplied with 2 combined A2P3 filters</strong> with <strong>bayonet connection</strong>, ideal for <strong>protection against organic vapors, fine dust, fumes, and mists,</strong> making it a reliable solution for those looking for an efficient and durable work mask.</p>
<h3>TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS</h3>
