('technologies','ALU','ALU','Light, recyclable, perfectly mouldable aluminium toe cap with the same mechanical resistance of the steel toe cap but more comfortable.',NULL,0),
('technologies','CF','CF safety toe cap','Very light carbon fiber toe cap with high impact resistance.',NULL,1),
('technologies','COMP','Light safety toe cap','Particularly lightweight composite toe cap that provides high thermal insulation and total foot protection in the event of objects falling from above, from impacts of up to 200J, which is equivalent to the energy caused by a stone of 10kg from a height of 2m.',NULL,2),
('technologies','EVA RUBBER','EVA Rubber - Ethylene Vinyl Acetate','Soft, light, and flexible polymer foam that blends the cushioning of rubber with the durability of plastic.',NULL,3),
('technologies','HIGH FLEX','High Flex Perforation proof midsole','Anti-puncture midsole made of high-strength and highly flexible synthetic polymer fiber. It contributes to high thermal insulation of the shoe. Extremely light and comfortable, the high flex midsole guarantees total protection of the foot from the risk of wounds, cuts and punctures.',NULL,4),
('technologies','INOX','Inox perforation proof midsole','Anti-puncture midsole made of high-hardness stainless steel. Ensures high resistance in case of contact with sharp materials such as nails, sharp blades, scrap metal. Protects the foot from injuries, cuts and punctures.',NULL,5),
('technologies','NHP REBOUND','NHP Ultra Rebound Technology','Midsole made of NHP Ultra Rebound Technology: the evolution for maximum elasticity, cushioning and lightweight.',NULL,6),
('technologies','NHP RUBBER','NHP-Rubber','Anti Skid System outsole for maximum stability even on the most slippery surfaces.',NULL,7),
('technologies','PS','PS','Perforation proof midsole tested with 3 mm conical nail.',NULL,8),
('technologies','PU PU','PU PU Sole','Polyurethane gives the sole lightness and flexibility. It has shock-absorbing features that guarantee high comfort for the entire shoe. The double injection of polyurethane makes it possible to obtain dual-coloured or dual-density soles. Polyurethane is injected onto the upper by means of special moulds: these are called ‘injected soles’ or simply ‘injected’.',NULL,9),
('technologies','PU R-SOLE','PU-Rubber sole','Anti Skid System rubber sole, maximum stability even on the most slippery surfaces.',NULL,10),
('technologies','PU SOLE','PU sole','Sole formed from a single injection of polyurethane (single-component polyurethane). The production moulds are simple and inexpensive, and the sole can only have one colour.',NULL,11),
('technologies','PVC','PVC','PVC (Polyvinyl Chloride) is a high-density, non-porous thermoplastic polymer engineered to provide 100% waterproof protection, high abrasion resistance, and long-lasting structural durability.',NULL,12),
('technologies','STEEL TOE','Hard safety toe cap','Steel safety toe-cap that provides total foot protection in the event of objects falling from heights from impacts of up to 200J, which is equivalent to the energy caused by a stone of 10kg from a height of 2m.',NULL,13);

